/T (This Brand Guideline establishes the visual and communication standards for Paperforce India LLP. It ensures consistency across all digital and print touchpoints, including the corporate website, social media, marketing collateral, product packaging, presentations, and future brand communications. The guidelines define the approved use of the logo, color palette, typography, imagery, UI components, and overall design language to maintain a professional, premium, and recognizable brand identity across every platform.)
/E (This Brand Guideline establishes the visual and communication standards for Paperforce India LLP. It ensures consistency across all digital and print touchpoints, including the corporate website, social media, marketing collateral, product packaging, presentations, and future brand communications. The guidelines define the approved use of the logo, color palette, typography, imagery, UI components, and overall design language to maintain a professional, premium, and recognizable brand identity across every platform.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
